      "body": "> Deferring `handleNotifications()` until after the availability check passes prevents the failing load from registering:\n\nThis introduces a different race. A block that arrives after the tip height is retrieved but before notifications are registered results in that block being missed. Early registration is to prevent this race.",
      "user": {
        "login": "achow101",
